From: PW3 Android port
Subject: [PW3] Launcher3: the home screen's search box outlined

The search box on the home screen (0004) was light grey with a 2dp elevation.
On PW3 the grey is one panel level below the white around it and the shadow is
not drawn (software rendering), so the box had no visible edge. As every
surface that stands out from the page (docs/design/eink-ui.md), it is white
with a black outline of 1dp (2 px) and corners of 4dp; Launcher3's copy of the
values is res/values/pw3_eink.xml.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/res/values/pw3_eink.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<!-- PW3: the e-paper interface rules (docs/design/eink-ui.md) as Launcher3 uses them.
+     Launcher3 is built against the public SDK and cannot use the framework's private
+     resources; the framework, SystemUI and Settings write the same values. -->
+<resources>
+    <color name="pw3_outline">#ff000000</color>
+    <!-- 2 px on PW3 (density 1.875, rounded to whole pixels). -->
+    <dimen name="pw3_outline_width">1dp</dimen>
+    <dimen name="pw3_corner_radius">4dp</dimen>
+</resources>
--- /dev/null
+++ b/res/drawable/pw3_search_box.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<!-- PW3: a search box is white with an outline (docs/design/eink-ui.md). A light grey
+     fill is one panel level below the white around it, and its shadow is not drawn
+     (software rendering): it had no visible edge. -->
+<shape xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
+       android:shape="rectangle">
+    <solid android:color="@android:color/white" />
+    <stroke android:width="@dimen/pw3_outline_width" android:color="@color/pw3_outline" />
+    <corners android:radius="@dimen/pw3_corner_radius" />
+</shape>
--- a/res/layout/qsb_default_view.xml
+++ b/res/layout/qsb_default_view.xml
@@ -23,8 +23,7 @@
         android:layout_height="48dp"
         android:layout_margin="8dp"
         android:layout_gravity="center_vertical"
-        android:background="@drawable/round_rect_primary"
-        android:elevation="2dp"
+        android:background="@drawable/pw3_search_box"
         android:focusableInTouchMode="true"
         android:orientation="horizontal">
 
